{"availability":"available","full":"f-tiger/verified-ai-free-tiers","name":"verified-ai-free-tiers","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"JavaScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-12T06:52:16Z","updated":"2026-10-17T01:24:31Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://baipiaoji.com/en/tools/playground-ai.html","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T05:14:56.363Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T05:14:56.363Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T05:14:56.363Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T06:14:54.474Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T05:14:56.363Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Free-tier limits of AI tools, hand-verified against official sources — every figure carries a source and a check date. Listed in the official MCP Registry as io.github.f-tiger/verified-ai-free-tiers.","Most \"best free AI tools\" lists repeat figures nobody can trace. This dataset does the opposite: a number is published only when an official vendor page states it, and the date it was checked travels with it. When a vendor publishes no figure, the entry says so instead of carrying a guess — for AI chat assistants, for instance, only 1 of 10 vendors publishes a message count at all.","多数「免费 AI 工具榜单」转述的数字查不到出处。这份数据集反过来做：只有官方页面写明的数字才发布，并带上核实日期；官方没公布的如实标注「未公布」，而不是填一个猜的数——比如对话助手这一类，10 家里只有 1 家真的公布了条数。"],"features":["📄 In this repo: limits.json ｜ limits.md — synced daily from baipiaoji.com（每日自动同步）","🧮 Structured comparison data（可比较的结构化对照，非散文）: — what each vendor meters, when it resets, whether a figure is published","🧾 Myth checks（流言核查，含哪些流传数字查无出处）: ｜","📚 Whole dataset in one file:","📊 Embeddable daily-quota widget:"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/f-tiger/verified-ai-free-tiers/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b9d74be6e023d7cdb1ec4eb2e9d49e5ad9ed2352acaa41db70271b4ae1be1a31","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:54